{"meta":{"id":"runtime","category":"it/syntax/typescript/compile","title":"실행 시점에도 영향을 주는 문법 · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"const 재할당 제한, 실제 객체 속성 변경, throw · 런타임 타입 검사, #private 필드","tags":["typescript","f-runtime"],"color":"rose","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-rose","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-rose-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-rose-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-rose-50 text-rose-700 border border-rose-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">실행 시점에도 영향을 주는 문법 · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-rose-50/70 border border-rose-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> const 재할당 제한, 실제 객체 속성 변경, throw · 런타임 타입 검사, #private 필드</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">JavaScript 실행 시점에도 영향을 주는 문법</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">문법</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">실행 시</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>const 의 변수 재할당 제한</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">JS 자체 규칙 — 실행 시 TypeError</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>실제 객체의 속성을 바꾸는 코드</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Object.freeze 등 — 실제 값이 바뀌거나 막힘</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>throw, 런타임 타입 검사</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">typeof / instanceof / in — 실행 중에 판단</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>JavaScript 의 #private 필드</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">클래스 밖에서 접근 시 실행 오류</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">예</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">const max = 10;\r\n// max = 20;                  // TypeError: Assignment to constant variable\r\n\r\nconst cfg = Object.freeze({ mode: &quot;dark&quot; });\r\n// cfg.mode = &quot;light&quot;;        // strict 모드에서 TypeError (값은 바뀌지 않음)\r\n\r\nfunction toNumber(x: unknown): number {\r\n  if (typeof x !== &quot;number&quot;) throw new Error(&quot;숫자 아님&quot;);   // 런타임 검사\r\n  return x;\r\n}\r\n\r\nclass Wallet { #balance = 0 }\r\n// (new Wallet() as any).#balance  // 문법 오류 — 진짜 비공개</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">정리</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-rose-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">TypeScript 의 타입은 <strong>개발 중 실수를 막는 도구</strong> — 실행 결과는 바꾸지 않는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-rose-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">외부 데이터(API, 사용자 입력)는 실행 시점 검사 코드가 있어야 안전하다</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> 컴파일 › 컴파일 시점에만 검사되는 제한, 클래스 › 접근 제한자</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/compile/runtime","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"compile","title":"컴파일","path":"it/syntax/typescript/compile"}],"hasImage":false}